        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: PJ Harvey, Nino Ramsby\n- Bands: Salt, Baxter, Grand Tone Music\n- Works: Auscultate, Bluster\n- Topics: alternative rock, grunge\n\nFacts:\n- PJ Harvey, born Polly Jean Harvey on 9 October 1969, is an English musician, singer-songwriter, writer, poet, and composer.\n- During the 1990s, Nino Ramsby was the vocalist and guitarist for the alternative rock band Salt.\n- During the 1990s, Nino Ramsby was also a member of the bands Baxter and Grand Tone Music.\n- Salt was a Swedish grunge and alternative rock band.\n- In 1996, Salt had a hit single in the United States with \"Bluster\" from the album \"Auscultate\".",
